<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Star My Repository</title>

<style>
body {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  background: #0d1117;
  color: white;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  min-height: 100vh;
}

.card {
  background: #161b22;
  padding: 35px 25px;
  border-radius: 18px;
  text-align: center;
  border: 1px solid #30363d;
  width: 280px;
}

.star {
  font-size: 65px;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}

h1 {
  font-size: 25px;
}

p {
  color: #c9d1d9;
  line-height: 1.6;
}

button {
  background: #f0c000;
  color: #111;
  border: none;
  padding: 13px 25px;
  border-radius: 10px;
  font-size: 16px;
  font-weight: bold;
  cursor: pointer;
}

button:hover {
  background: #ffd633;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>
<div class="card">
  <div class="star">⭐</div>
  <h1>Star My Repository</h1>
  <p>আমার GitHub Repository ভালো লাগলে একটি Star দিয়ে সাপোর্ট করো!</p>

  <button onclick="window.open(
  'https://github.com/YOUR-USERNAME/YOUR-REPO',
  '_blank'
  )">
  ⭐ Give a Star
  </button>
</div>
</body>
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>StarX | Premium Website</title>

<style>
* {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
}

body {
    background: #080b14;
    color: white;
    min-height: 100vh;
}

header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 20px 7%;
    background: #101525;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #252d43;
}

.logo {
    font-size: 25px;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #65f5c5;
}

nav a {
    color: #ddd;
    text-decoration: none;
    margin-left: 18px;
    font-size: 14px;
}

.hero {
    min-height: 75vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 35px 20px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse at top, #173b4c 0%, #080b14 65%);
}

.badge {
    padding: 9px 17px;
    border: 1px solid #65f5c5;
    color: #65f5c5;
    border-radius: 30px;
    font-size: 13px;
    margin-bottom: 25px;
}

h1 {
    font-size: clamp(38px, 8vw, 68px);
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
}

h1 span {
    color: #65f5c5;
}

.hero p {
    max-width: 540px;
    color: #b4bdcf;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
}

.buttons {
    display: flex;
    gap: 14px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
}

.btn {
    padding: 14px 25px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: bold;
    transition: 0.3s;
}

.primary {
    background: #65f5c5;
    color: #07120f;
}

.secondary {
    border: 1px solid #424d65;
    color: white;
}

.btn:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
}

.features {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
    gap: 20px;
    padding: 40px 7%;
}

.card {
    background: #111827;
    border: 1px solid #263047;
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 28px 22px;
    transition: 0.3s;
}

.card:hover {
    border-color: #65f5c5;
    transform: translateY(-5px);
}

.icon {
    font-size: 35px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
}

.card h2 {
    font-size: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.card p {
    color: #aab4c7;
    line-height: 1.7;
    font-size: 14px;
}

footer {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 25px 15px;
    color: #8b96aa;
    border-top: 1px solid #252d43;
    font-size: 13px;
}

@media (max-width: 500px) {
    header {
        padding: 18px 5%;
    }

    .logo {
        font-size: 21px;
    }

    nav a {
        margin-left: 9px;
        font-size: 12px;
    }

    .hero {
        min-height: 65vh;
    }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <div class="logo">✦ StarX</div>

    <nav>
        <a href="#home">Home</a>
        <a href="#features">Features</a>
